WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.489
A cycle ends. Then what?

00:00:02.933 --> 00:00:08.877
End a program and its cycle report opens. Records, ratios and bar speed.

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:13.559
It names what limited you. Then it points to your next cycle.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.158
Records and ratios, start against end.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.594
Lifting Lab is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
